{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51375","headline":"游安禅寺 · 徐凝","name":"游安禅寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲到安禅游圣概，先观涌塔出香城。\n楼台有日连云汉，壑谷无年断水声。\n倚竹并肩青玉立，上桥如踏白虹行。\n伤嗟置寺碑交碎，不见梁朝施主名。\n（《严陵集》一）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐凝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51375.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51375","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}